      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠲᠠᠲᠠᠯᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>tadalqu</uighur>
      <cyrillic>татлах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>TATAL-</transcript>
      <definition>v t. To pull repeatedly or all the time; to draw to oneself; to write in cursive. [Mo.] To wiredraw, draw into wire; to tear with the teeth (as a wolf).</definition>
      <page>787</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠠᠲᠠᠯᠵᠤ ᠪᠢᠴᠢᠺᠦ</unicode>
          <transcript>--zu biciky</transcript>
          <definition> To write in cursive writing.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
